# LOCAL TEST COPY of League of Legends' Aatrox (Riot Games IP) - never publish. Engine test only.
# Numbers: LoL wiki Aatrox/LoL (current patch, read 2026-10-30). Rank-1 values; per-rank growth via *_rank fields.
#
# UNITS (checked against the built-ins, e.g. Stone Warden hp 66'000 = "hp = 660"; skill dmg/range are plain LoL-like numbers)
#   hp, attack, defence, elemental_defence, move_speed, *_per_level: LoL value 1:1 (the parser multiplies by 100)
#   attack_range is EDGE to edge: LoL 175 (centre to centre, minus ~65+65 radii) -> 55, like Oathless Duelist
#   attack_speed = base AS x 100 (0.651 -> 65). Skill ranges/widths: LoL units = game units. Times: ms.
#   Ratios: ad = % of attack (LoL % AD 1:1). dmg_rank = damage added per rank above 1.
#
# KEY LAYOUT: the Q key is a Q option and cannot be custom, so it is a filler (Chi Strike). The LoL kit sits on
#   W = LoL Q, E = LoL W, R = LoL E, Y = LoL R (ultimate), T = LoL R companion, P = passive.
base = Oathless Duelist
name = Aatrox
role = Fighter
hp = 650
hp_per_level = 114
attack = 60
attack_per_level = 5
defence = 38
elemental_defence = 32
move_speed = 345
attack_range = 55
attack_speed = 65
colour = 8b1a2b
crits = 1                # [U-463] LoL champion: crit chance 0 %, crit damage 175 % (items add chance)
# [U-460] the model (tools/art/make_models.py): a tall winged darkin with a huge glowing-eye greatsword
model.body = broad
model.height = 2.2
model.weapon = greatsword
model.extras = wings horns pauldrons glow_eyes
model.accent = ff2a20
model.ortho = 3.2
q1 = Chi Strike
q2 = Knife Throw
q3 = Bolas Throw

# ---- LoL Q The Darkin Blade -> key W. 3 DIFFERENT casts (stage1..3), 4 s window, 14/12/10/8/6 s, cast 0.6 s,
